# Quiz

=== layout: two-panels

# *Quiz System Information*

@left

- Full quiz: 20 points; 20-34 questions
- MC\: 1 point; matching\: 1/2 per choice
- 20-30 minutes; about 1-1.5 min/question
- Normally: backtracking allowed; random order
- Limited calculations
- Both attempts\: (individual + group)/2
- Example\: (14 + 20)/2 = 17

@right

- Individual attempt\: opens 20 hours before class
- Complete it before class
- Optional group quiz\: in person during class
- 3-4 students; form a group in class
- Group score: at least 18/20; curve if needed

@citation

https://vosslab.github.io/syllabus/fall_2026/genetics/ASSIGNMENTS_AND_GRADING/

